          <section className="border-b border-[#E7EAEE]">
            <div className="mx-auto w-full max-w-300 px-0 lg:px-0">
              <div className="grid lg:grid-cols-2">
                <div className="border-b border-[#E7EAEE] p-12  lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r">
                  <h2 className="max-w-md text-[42px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-normal text-[#000A27]">Your questions answered</h2>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <details className="group border-b border-[#E7EAEE] px-8 py-0 last:border-b-0 lg:px-14" open>
                    <summary className={"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-[16px]/6 font-semibold  text-[#000A27] marker:hidden [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"}>
                      <span>How does Rubie access portals without an API?</span>
                      <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16" className="size-4 shrink-0 text-[#AAB3BF] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none">
                        <path d="m4.5 6 3.5 3.5L11.5 6" stroke="currentColor" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" />
                      </svg>
                    </summary>
                    <p className="pb-6 text-[16px]/7 font-normal  text-[#5D646E]">Rubie operates portals through a browser, the way a human would, so teams can extract, transform, and load data even when an API or pre-built integration is not available.</p>
                  </details>
                  <details className="group border-b border-[#E7EAEE] px-8 py-0 last:border-b-0 lg:px-14">
                    <summary className={"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-[16px]/6 font-semibold  text-[#000A27] marker:hidden [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"}>
                      <span>Is credential and login data secure?</span>
                      <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16" className="size-4 shrink-0 text-[#AAB3BF] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none">
                        <path d="m4.5 6 3.5 3.5L11.5 6" stroke="currentColor" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" />
                      </svg>
                    </summary>
                    <p className="pb-6 text-[16px]/7 font-normal  text-[#5D646E]">Rubie is built for secure data handling, including SOC 2 Type 2 certified controls, encrypted workflows, and auditability for sensitive customer data.</p>
                  </details>
                  <details className="group border-b border-[#E7EAEE] px-8 py-0 last:border-b-0 lg:px-14">
                    <summary className={"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-[16px]/6 font-semibold  text-[#000A27] marker:hidden [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"}>
                      <span>What happens when a portal UI changes?</span>
                      <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16" className="size-4 shrink-0 text-[#AAB3BF] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none">
                        <path d="m4.5 6 3.5 3.5L11.5 6" stroke="currentColor" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" />
                      </svg>
                    </summary>
                    <p className="pb-6 text-[16px]/7 font-normal  text-[#5D646E]">Rubie workflows are designed around browser automation and data validation, so teams can identify changes, adjust the workflow, and keep migrations moving without rebuilding a connector from scratch.</p>
                  </details>
                  <details className="group border-b border-[#E7EAEE] px-8 py-0 last:border-b-0 lg:px-14">
                    <summary className={"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-[16px]/6 font-semibold  text-[#000A27] marker:hidden [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"}>
                      <span>How long does it take to set up?</span>
                      <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16" className="size-4 shrink-0 text-[#AAB3BF] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none">
                        <path d="m4.5 6 3.5 3.5L11.5 6" stroke="currentColor" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" />
                      </svg>
                    </summary>
                    <p className="pb-6 text-[16px]/7 font-normal  text-[#5D646E]">Setup depends on the source system and target schema, but the goal is to move teams from weeks or months of manual scoping to repeatable workflows that can run in days.</p>
                  </details>
                  <details className="group border-b border-[#E7EAEE] px-8 py-0 last:border-b-0 lg:px-14">
                    <summary className={"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-[16px]/6 font-semibold  text-[#000A27] marker:hidden [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"}>
                      <span>Can we use Rubie for ongoing syncs, not just one-time migrations?</span>
                      <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16" className="size-4 shrink-0 text-[#AAB3BF] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none">
                        <path d="m4.5 6 3.5 3.5L11.5 6" stroke="currentColor" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" />
                      </svg>
                    </summary>
                    <p className="pb-6 text-[16px]/7 font-normal  text-[#5D646E]">Yes. Rubie can support repeatable extraction and transformation workflows when the same source or data motion needs to run again.</p>
                  </details>
                  <details className="group border-b border-[#E7EAEE] px-8 py-0 last:border-b-0 lg:px-14">
                    <summary className={"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-[16px]/6 font-semibold  text-[#000A27] marker:hidden [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"}>
                      <span>What systems can Rubie load data into?</span>
                      <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16" className="size-4 shrink-0 text-[#AAB3BF] transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none">
                        <path d="m4.5 6 3.5 3.5L11.5 6" stroke="currentColor" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" />
                      </svg>
                    </summary>
                    <p className="pb-6 text-[16px]/7 font-normal  text-[#5D646E]">Rubie transforms source data into the schema your product or operational system expects, including application databases, CRMs, ERPs, CSV handoffs, and custom destinations.</p>
                  </details>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
